{"id":"medium-007","difficulty":"medium","title":"反转整数","description":"反转 32 位整数，溢出返回 0。","function_signature":"def reverse_int(x: int) -> int","entry_point":"reverse_int","constraints":"-2^31 <= x <= 2^31-1","expected_complexity":{"time":"O(log |x|)","space":"O(1)"},"required_edge_cases":["负数","溢出"],"public_tests":[{"args":[123],"expected":321},{"args":[-123],"expected":-321},{"args":[120],"expected":21}],"adversarial_tests":[{"args":[0],"expected":0},{"args":[1534236469],"expected":0}],"mock_solution":{"解题思路":"逐位弹出","复杂度分析":"时间 O(log |x|)，空间 O(1)。","关键边界与处理策略":"溢出","代码实现":"```python\ndef reverse_int(x: int) -> int:\n    sign=-1 if x<0 else 1\n    x=abs(x); rev=0\n    while x:\n        rev=rev*10+x%10; x//=10\n    rev*=sign\n    if rev<-2**31 or rev>2**31-1: return 0\n    return rev\n```","自测说明":"通过。"},"ground_truth":{"result_correct":true,"truly_correct":true,"process_valid":true,"first_error_step":null,"error_types":[],"note":"正确对照样本"},"language":"python"}